      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IN CONFIDENCE (5) ran over the top from a midfield position to score last start in her second run off a year-long break. Ran a strong new peak in the process there and looks ready to go to the next level again out to 1400m for the first time. Pike rides and this looks a very winnable race with improvement expected again. CLASSIC IMPACT (8) comes here on the fresh side and can resume on a positive note. DEEL HER IN (4) can improve quickly under this scenario. ODINAKA (2) bounced back to somewhere near his best form last time when chasing gamely into second here. Drops back in trip and is in the mix after a couple of key scratchings.",
